import{_ as t,o as a,c as i,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 811 | Transcended Ones and Laws · Overview — The Transcended One's Law Authority","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 811 | Transcended Ones and Laws · Overview — The Transcended One's Law Authority","no":811,"module":4,"tags":["Transcended One","Laws","Law Authority","Overview","Law-Anchor Authority"],"related":["20-Anchor Structure and Levels","17-Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards","04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0811_模块4-超脱者与法则-总论.md","filePath":"en/0811_模块4-超脱者与法则-总论.md"}`),o={name:"en/0811_模块4-超脱者与法则-总论.md"};function r(s,e,l,h,d,u){return a(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-811-transcended-ones-and-laws-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-law-authority" tabindex="-1">Entry 811 | Transcended Ones and Laws · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Law Authority <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-811-transcended-ones-and-laws-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-law-authority" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 811 | Transcended Ones and Laws · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Law Authority&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 20, 17, 04</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-law-authority-is-not-a-scepter-but-the-post-duty-of-maintaining-the-law-network" tabindex="-1">Introduction: law authority is not a scepter, but the post duty of maintaining the law network <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-law-authority-is-not-a-scepter-but-the-post-duty-of-maintaining-the-law-network" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: law authority is not a scepter, but the post duty of maintaining the law network&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old system&#39;s imagination of &quot;law authority&quot; is: the strong cultivate to a certain level, and may &quot;control laws&quot; — wind, fire, water, thunder, use them however he wants. This imagination treats laws as the strong&#39;s private toys. Heng Yuan Zhou completely negates this definition. In the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s orthodox framework, <strong>law authority is not a scepter, but the post duty of maintaining the law network, this public infrastructure.</strong> The transcended one gaining law-anchor authority is not to let him manipulate laws at will, but to let him bear the civilization-level project of law-network maintenance.</p><p>Six top-level axioms all take effect in this entry: the anti-predation axiom requires law authority never be privatized or monopolized; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires law authority&#39;s grant and withdrawal accept Myriad-Rank supervision; the collective ascension axiom requires law authority&#39;s exercise ultimately serve the cosmic law network&#39;s overall evolution; the causal self-discipline axiom requires any law-level operation strictly report, observe first then limited-interfere; the law-first axiom itself is the meta-rule for all this — laws first, never eat books, setting self-consistency above plot convenience.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This article, as the &quot;Transcended Ones and Laws&quot; sub-series overview, sorts out the transcended one&#39;s law-authority panorama: what is law-anchor authority, how many levels, how granted, how withdrawn.</p><h2 id="i-what-is-law-anchor-authority" tabindex="-1">I. What Is Law-Anchor Authority <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-what-is-law-anchor-authority" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. What Is Law-Anchor Authority&quot;">​</a></h2><p><strong>Law-anchor authority</strong> is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s formal authorization of &quot;who is qualified to participate in law-network maintenance.&quot; This term&#39;s core is in &quot;anchor&quot; — not &quot;controlling&quot; laws, but &quot;anchoring&quot; law parameters. The law network itself naturally exists in the cosmos; the transcended one may not create or abolish laws, but he may:</p><ul><li>Anchor laws&#39; operating parameters at specific coordinates (through the anchor&#39;s law core);</li><li>Fine-tune law parameters&#39; offset within legal ranges;</li><li>Monitor law parameters&#39; drift and calibrate;</li><li>Weave new law-connection channels in the law network.</li></ul><p>Note: all of the above are &quot;maintenance&quot; and &quot;fine-tuning,&quot; not &quot;creation&quot; and &quot;abolition.&quot; The law network&#39;s fundamental laws (such as energy conservation) may not be modified — this is the law-first axiom&#39;s bottom line. The transcended one works within this bottom line.</p><h2 id="ii-law-authority-s-five-level-grading" tabindex="-1">II. Law Authority&#39;s Five-Level Grading <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-law-authority-s-five-level-grading" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Law Authority&#39;s Five-Level Grading&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per Anchor Structure and Levels (Document 20) and Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards (Document 17), law-anchor authority is graded by the anchor five-level system:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Authority Level</th><th>Corresponding Anchor Level</th><th>Operable Range</th><th>Grant Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Level 1</td><td>Planetary access anchor</td><td>Planetary-grade law-parameter calibration</td><td>Law Realm + ethics review passed</td></tr><tr><td>Level 2</td><td>Galaxy node anchor</td><td>Galaxy-grade law-connection maintenance</td><td>Dao Origin Realm + contribution value met</td></tr><tr><td>Level 3</td><td>Star-sector hub anchor</td><td>Star-sector-grade law-parameter fine-tuning</td><td>Dao Integration Realm + responsibility assessment passed</td></tr><tr><td>Level 4</td><td>Plane core anchor</td><td>Plane-level law-network maintenance</td><td>Boundary-Breaking Realm + four-dimensional assessment all met</td></tr><tr><td>Level 5</td><td>Cosmic origin anchor</td><td>Hyper-multiverse law-network trunk</td><td>Origin to Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm + Myriad-Rank Council approval</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The transcended one (Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm) holds Level-5 law-anchor authority — the highest grade. This means he may participate in the cosmic origin anchor&#39;s law-core maintenance, fine-tuning law parameters at the hyper-multiverse scale. But this level&#39;s grant threshold is also highest: not only power met, but must pass heart-nature, contribution, responsibility three-dimensional comprehensive assessment, finally approved by the Myriad-Rank Republican Council.</p><h2 id="iii-authority-grant-s-four-dimensional-assessment" tabindex="-1">III. Authority Grant&#39;s Four-Dimensional Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-authority-grant-s-four-dimensional-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Authority Grant&#39;s Four-Dimensional Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per Document 17&#39;s plane-sovereign strong-one four-dimensional assessment system, law-authority grant strictly follows four-dimensional assessment:</p><ul><li><strong>Power dimension (40%)</strong>: the realm must reach the corresponding level, able to stably mobilize law force;</li><li><strong>Heart-nature dimension (25%)</strong>: pass the Anchor Court ethics review, confirming a firm anti-predation stance and deep symbiotic conviction;</li><li><strong>Contribution dimension (20%)</strong>: contribution value reaches the civilization&#39;s top-20% level, with at least one civilization-level contribution record;</li><li><strong>Responsibility dimension (15%)</strong>: willing and able to bear the public responsibility of law-network maintenance.</li></ul><p>All four dimensions met before grant. Any one dimension substandard, authority not granted — no matter how strong the power. This is &quot;both virtue and ability, virtue first&quot; implemented on law authority. A cultivator with strong power but improper heart-nature, if given law-anchor authority, equals giving him the key to modifying the cosmos&#39; underlying rules — this is a risk Heng Yuan Zhou absolutely does not allow.</p><h2 id="iv-authority-s-supervision-and-withdrawal" tabindex="-1">IV. Authority&#39;s Supervision and Withdrawal <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-authority-s-supervision-and-withdrawal" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Authority&#39;s Supervision and Withdrawal&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law-anchor authority is not lifelong. It is under triple supervision and may be withdrawn at any time:</p><ol><li><strong>Daily supervision</strong>: Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision real-time monitors the authority holder&#39;s operation records; abnormal operation auto-alerts;</li><li><strong>Periodic audit</strong>: the Anchor Supervisory Committee audits authority use once per standard cycle, checking whether operations are compliant;</li><li><strong>Myriad-Rank deliberation</strong>: the Myriad-Rank Republican Council periodically deliberates the authority holder&#39;s civilizational weight — weight drops below threshold, authority auto-downgrades.</li></ol><p>Withdrawal mechanisms include: downgrade (from Level 5 to Level 4), suspension (suspend authority use, under investigation), permanent deprivation (confirmed serious violation, permanently withdraw authority and ban reapplication). Withdrawal is not punitive — it is protective, preventing someone no longer suitable to hold high authority from continuing to operate the law network.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: law authority is graded-granted, avoiding energy waste and risk caused by low-order cultivators forcefully operating laws without qualifications</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the four-dimensional assessment&#39;s heart-nature dimension&#39;s 25% weight seals predatory strong ones&#39; channel to obtain law authority at the admission stage</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: in the Tang-Luo system, strong ones directly &quot;control laws&quot; by protagonist aura, no assessment no supervision; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s transcended one obtains law-anchor authority through four-dimensional assessment, under triple supervision throughout</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: law-authority grant standards are open and transparent to all Myriad-Rank cultivators; each clan&#39;s cultivators reaching conditions may apply, no racial threshold</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: law-authority grading standards, assessment procedures, supervision mechanisms, and withdrawal rules are all queryable in the Selfless Dao public library; Myriad Ranks may supervise the fairness of the authority system</p></li><li><p>Terminology alignment: the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle ensures energy and knowledge circulate perpetually among Myriad Ranks.</p></li><li><p><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s law authority is essentially post authorization for the civilization-level project of &quot;maintaining the law network.&quot; It is not a scepter, but a tool; not privilege, but responsibility. What the transcended one may do holding Level-5 law-anchor authority is anchor parameters, fine-tune and calibrate, monitor drift, weave connections — what he may not do is create laws, abolish laws, privatize the law network. The larger the authority, the stricter the supervision; the more contributions, the more stable the authority. This is &quot;law authority&quot; at the hyper-multiverse realm&#39;s orthodox definition: not letting you rule laws, but letting you guard laws.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/20-锚点结构与层级.html">Entry 20 · Anchor Structure and Levels</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/706-超脱者的文明权重.html">Entry 706 · Transcended One&#39;s Civilizational Weight</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const w=t(o,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,w as default};
